  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      51.45,
      328.69,
      536.24,
      352.24
    ],
    "text": "FILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF MEMBER OF THE KALUTARA PRADESHIYA SABHAUNDER SECTION 66A(1) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 262)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      365.17,
      482.86,
      376.24
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the office of member of Kalutara Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of resignation ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      389.17,
      539.92,
      448.24
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Secretary of the United People\u2019s Freedom Alliance, the recognized political party to whichJanage Don Shantha Kumara the member belonged, was required by me under Section 66A(1) of the aforesaid Ordinance,to decide upon returned member if United People\u2019s Freedom Alliance who belongs to such party and is not disqualifiedunder Section 9 of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance and who shall be declared selected as a member within aperiod of thirty (30) days ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      461.17,
      539.92,
      484.24
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision tonominate Suduhakuruge Ketin to fill such vacancy ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      497.17,
      539.9,
      532.24
    ],
    "text": "NOW THEREFORE I, Pahala Ralalage Nalaka Hemantha Rathnayake, returning officer of the Kalutara PradeshiyaSabha acting in terms of Section 66A(1) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) do hereby declare thatSuduhakuruge Ketin was selected as the member of the Kalutara Pradeshiya Sabha.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      416.25,
      557.17,
      525.45,
      592.24
    ],
    "text": "NALAKA RATHNAYAKE,Returning Officer,Kalutara Pradeshiya Sabha.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      605.17,
      148.66,
      642.76
    ],
    "text": "District Election Office,Kalutara,08th November, 2018,",
